WEBVTT

00:00:28.916 --> 00:00:33.116
And then the day finally came
when we would meet face to face.

00:00:33.996 --> 00:00:35.836
So I walk into the meeting room,

00:00:35.876 --> 00:00:37.196
and there she is.

00:00:37.196 --> 00:00:38.476
I say hello,

00:00:38.516 --> 00:00:40.716
and she kind of gives me this odd look.

00:00:40.716 --> 00:00:42.636
And she says,

00:00:42.676 --> 00:00:45.596
"Oh, you must work for Mariam."

00:00:46.436 --> 00:00:48.036
(Audience murmurs)

00:00:48.916 --> 00:00:50.916
And I'm thinking, "What does she mean?"

00:00:50.956 --> 00:00:52.716
And then it dawns on me.

00:00:52.716 --> 00:00:53.996
She must think

00:00:54.036 --> 00:00:57.076
I'm the legal secretary
or the assistant perhaps.

00:00:57.116 --> 00:01:00.196
Not that there's anything
wrong with having those jobs.